## 1. Business Overview

Organizers currently track event sign-ups manually using spreadsheets or email threads. This leads to overbooking, no self-service registration for attendees, no visibility into who is attending, and no way to handle payments, cancellations, or full events in a structured way.

EventPulse is a web-based event registration system that lets attendees browse and register for events online, lets organizers manage events and capacity, and automates the workflows around payment, refunds, cancellations, waitlisting, and check-in.

### 1.1 Stakeholders

- **Attendee** — browses events, registers, pays, cancels if needed
- **Organizer** — creates and manages events, views attendees and revenue
- **Admin** — manages organizer accounts and oversees the platform

### 1.2 User Roles & Permissions

| Role | Can Do |
| --- | --- |
| Attendee | Browse events, register, pay, view own registrations, cancel, receive refund, view QR ticket |
| Organizer | Create/edit/delete own events, set capacity & price, view attendee list, view transactions, scan QR for check-in |
| Admin | Manage organizer accounts, view all events and transactions across the platform |

