## 3. Non-Functional Requirements

| Category | Requirement |
| --- | --- |
| Security | Role-based access control; only authenticated users can register or manage events |
| Validation | No registration beyond capacity; no double registration by the same attendee; no negative price/capacity |
| Performance | Event listing and attendee lists are paginated |
| Auditability | Every registration, payment, refund, and check-in is timestamped |
| Usability | QR ticket and payment status are visible to the attendee at every stage |

